
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
File for submitting this DAG to HTCondor           : campaign.dag.condor.sub
Log of DAGMan debugging messages                   : campaign.dag.dagman.out
Log of HTCondor library output                     : campaign.dag.lib.out
Log of HTCondor library error messages             : campaign.dag.lib.err
Log of the life of condor_dagman itself            : campaign.dag.dagman.log

-no_submit given, not submitting DAG to HTCondor. You can do this with:
"condor_submit campaign.dag.condor.sub"
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
